  "bio": "Harley Fezekas is a highly skilled tattoo artist, renowned for their expertise in newschool, realism, and black & gray styles. Known for their meticulousness, Harley maintains an exceptional standard of cleanliness in their practice, ensuring a safe and hygienic experience for every client. To discuss your next piece of body art, reach out to Harley at Venture Tattoo via DM or email at har.har@live.com.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location:\n\nTattoo artist @venturetattoo\n423 N. marion st. ,Oak Park, IL \nFor tattoo inquiries,DM or email hdftattoos@gmail.com books are always open!\n\nTattoo artist @venturetattoo\n423 N. marion st. ,Oak Park, IL \nFor tattoo inquiries,DM or email hdftattoos@gmail.com books are always open!",
